        <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 5: Direct Evaporative Cooling in Arid Climate</p>
    <p bold="true">Simulation of direct evaporative cooling (swamp cooler) operating in hot, desert ambient conditions.</p>
    <p bold="true">Intake air at 40 °C, 15% RH is adiabatically humidified across a media pack with 85% saturation effectiveness.</p>
    </content>
